# never reads it, so committing it would only pin dev environments.
uv.lock

# Claude Code's worktrees live here. Each one is a checkout of this repository
# on its own branch, with its own uncommitted work; committing them would nest
# a checkout inside the checkout and carry someone's in-progress edits with it.
.claude/
